  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 出品。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Stack Refill 是一款实用模组，当玩家的背包中存在相同物品时，会自动将玩家手中的物品堆叠补充至满。它适用于战斗中的武器、挖掘方块的工具、放置方块时的堆叠、进食、使用药水、向地面投掷物品、饮用牛奶桶、以及鱼竿损坏等情况，并且应该能兼容所有模组添加的方块。这是我个人非常喜欢的提升游戏体验的小优化。<br><br>为了获得最佳可靠性，必须在<strong>客户端</strong>和<strong>服务器</strong>两端同时安装。仅安装在服务端也可使用，但这可能会导致一些视觉不同步的问题。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 QoL 合集\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>战斗时自动替换剑：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>挖掘泥土时自动替换铲子：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>放置原木方块时自动替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"586\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>食用面包后自动替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>饮用药水后自动替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>投掷物品后自动替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"608\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>饮用牛奶桶后自动替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/g.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鱼竿最后一次使用后自动替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/h.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在（模组）方块上使用物品时，例如来自 Ex Nihilo 的筛子：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/i.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"516\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用该模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有已发布模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中统一管理评论，评论区已关闭。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问我们的&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
